OL,3,GNEWSATwo men found injured after
OL,4,Areported assault
OL,5,
OL,6,FFour people have been arrested after
OL,7,Ftwo men were found injured after a
OL,8,Freported assault, police said.
OL,10,FAvon and Somerset Police said officers
OL,11,Ffound a man seriously injured on Temple
OL,12,FStreet in Bristol at about 07:39 GMT on
OL,13,FMonday. A second man was found injured
OL,14,Finside a nearby flat.
OL,16,FTwo men and two women have been
OL,17,Farrested on suspicion of wounding with
OL,18,Fintent.
OL,20,FBoth of the injured men were taken to
OL,21,Fhospital, and their injuries are
OL,22,Fdescribed as not life-threatening.
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
